    ##  Represents the sheet metal part validation checker types. 
    ## <list type="table"> 
    ## <listheader><term> 
    ## Enumerator</term><description> 
    ## Comment</description> </listheader><item><term> 
    ## CheckBendAngle</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking bend angle </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckBendRadius</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the minimum value of inside bend radius </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckBendHeight</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the bend height </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckBendDirection</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether all bends have the same direction </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckCutoutCorner</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the cutout corner radius and angle </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckCutoutShape</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether a cutout has the standard shape </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckCutoutSize</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether a cutout size meets the size criteria </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckBendToBendDistance</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the minimum distance between bends </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckCutoutToBendDistance</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the minimum distance between a cutout and a bend </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckCutoutToCutoutDistance</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the minimum distance between cutouts </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckCylindricalBendFace</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether a bend face is a B-spline cylindrical face </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckCoaxisForMultipleBends</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether the cylindrical bend faces are coaxial </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckTangentBetweenBendAndTab</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether a bend face and adjacent tab faces are tangent </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckBendThickness</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether the bend thickness is identical to the sheet metal part thickness </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckInvalidAdjFaceToBend</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether the adjacent faces to bend are B-surfaces or non-planar faces </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckHemClearance</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether the clearance of a hem feature meets the minimum clearance criterion </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckBendSharpCorner</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking whether the inside bend has the sharp corner </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckPartThickness</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the sheet metal part thickness </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckPartVolume</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the sheet metal part volume </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## Count</term><description> 
    ##  Not used </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckNBend</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the N Bend features </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckZBend</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the Z Bend features </description> </item><item><term> 
    ## CheckVBend</term><description> 
    ##  Represents checking the V Bend features </description> </item></list>
    class CheckerType(Enum):
        """
        Members Include: <CheckBendAngle> <CheckBendRadius> <CheckBendHeight> <CheckBendDirection> <CheckCutoutCorner> <CheckCutoutShape> <CheckCutoutSize> <CheckBendToBendDistance> <CheckCutoutToBendDistance> <CheckCutoutToCutoutDistance> <CheckCylindricalBendFace> <CheckCoaxisForMultipleBends> <CheckTangentBetweenBendAndTab> <CheckBendThickness> <CheckInvalidAdjFaceToBend> <CheckHemClearance> <CheckBendSharpCorner> <CheckPartThickness> <CheckPartVolume> <Count> <CheckNBend> <CheckZBend> <CheckVBend>
        """
        CheckBendAngle: int
        CheckBendRadius: int
        CheckBendHeight: int
        CheckBendDirection: int
        CheckCutoutCorner: int
        CheckCutoutShape: int
